OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and
OL,6,Fsettled night with mostly cloudy
OL,7,Fskies, though some clear intervals
OL,8,Fstill possible. Winds strengthening
OL,9,Facross the west, especially the
OL,10,Fcoasts, but lighter winds elsewhere
OL,11,Fwhere a little chilly.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA dry and mostly cloudy
OL,14,Fmorning with some brightness. Cloud
OL,15,Flowering and becoming thicker in the
OL,16,Fafternoon with some light rain
OL,17,Fpossible. Winds strengthening,
OL,18,Fstrongest near western coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
