OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,FWednesday with strong winds and heavy
OL,7,Frain spreading east, dry and clear
OL,8,Flater. Mostly dry with sunny spells
OL,9,FThursday and winds easing. Cloudy
OL,10,FFriday with rain spreading east.
